1
00:00:01,007 --> 00:00:03,387
♪

2
00:00:05,217 --> 00:00:06,347
Eugeo: KIRITO.

3
00:00:06,347 --> 00:00:09,477
( Kirito murmurs )

4
00:00:09,477 --> 00:00:11,187
Eugeo: KIRITO!

5
00:00:11,187 --> 00:00:13,567
( Kirito moans )

6
00:00:13,567 --> 00:00:16,737
JUST FIVE MORE MINUTES.

7
00:00:16,737 --> 00:00:19,277
Eugeo: COME ON.
I KNOW IT’S OUR DAY OF REST

8
00:00:19,277 --> 00:00:21,407
BUT YOU SLEEP TOO MUCH!

9
00:00:21,407 --> 00:00:24,237
( Kirito moaning )

10
00:00:30,037 --> 00:00:31,577
GOOD MORNING, EUGEO.

11
00:00:31,577 --> 00:00:33,037
( Eugeo chuckles ) GOOD MORNING.

12
00:00:33,037 --> 00:00:34,707
WANT TO GO INTO TOWN TODAY?

13
00:00:34,707 --> 00:00:37,297
THE SUN’S OUT

14
00:00:39,047 --> 00:00:40,257
♪

15
00:00:40,257 --> 00:00:42,547
♪ SHINY SWORD, MY DIAMOND ♪

16
00:00:42,547 --> 00:00:44,427
( singing in Japanese )

17
00:00:55,567 --> 00:00:56,567
♪ IT’S TIME ♪

18
00:00:56,567 --> 00:00:58,397
( singing in Japanese )

19
00:01:14,667 --> 00:01:16,587
♪

20
00:01:18,667 --> 00:01:20,667
( overlapping chatter )

21
00:02:15,167 --> 00:02:16,757
Vendor: ENJOY THE PASTRIES!

22
00:02:18,797 --> 00:02:21,217
Kirito: MMM. DAMN, THAT’S YUMMY!

23
00:02:21,217 --> 00:02:23,887
Eugeo: CAN’T YOU WAIT
’TIL WE GET HOME?

24
00:02:23,887 --> 00:02:26,017
Kirito: NO. THEY TASTE BETTER

25
00:02:26,017 --> 00:02:27,187
WHEN THEY’RE
FRESH OUT OF THE OVEN.

26
00:02:27,187 --> 00:02:28,187
WANNA HAVE A BITE?

27
00:02:28,187 --> 00:02:29,477
Eugeo: NO, THANKS.

28
00:02:29,477 --> 00:02:31,067
I’M GOOD FOR NOW. MAYBE LATER.

29
00:02:31,067 --> 00:02:32,527
Kirito: SUIT YOURSELF.

30
00:02:32,527 --> 00:02:36,027
MAN, I CAN’T BELIEVE
HOW TIME FLIES.

31
00:02:36,027 --> 00:02:38,857
WE LEFT RULID, WHAT

32
00:02:38,857 --> 00:02:42,237
Eugeo: YEAH. SO MUCH
HAS HAPPENED TO US SINCE THEN.

33
00:02:42,237 --> 00:02:43,237
LET’S SEE.

34
00:02:43,237 --> 00:02:46,117
FIRST, WE WENT TO ZAKKARIA.

35
00:02:50,037 --> 00:02:52,667
WE GOT TO HONE
OUR SWORDSMAN SKILLS QUITE A BIT

36
00:02:52,667 --> 00:02:55,167
WHILE LIVING
AND WORKING ON THAT FARM.

37
00:02:55,167 --> 00:02:56,667
( Eugeo grunts )

38
00:02:56,667 --> 00:02:58,257
♪

39
00:03:01,007 --> 00:03:03,177
( yells )

40
00:03:03,177 --> 00:03:05,137
( crowd gasps )

41
00:03:05,137 --> 00:03:06,727
♪

42
00:03:18,067 --> 00:03:19,777
( Kirito yells )

43
00:03:19,777 --> 00:03:21,117
( sword shatters )

44
00:03:24,947 --> 00:03:26,907
Eugeo: WE WON THE SWORD-FIGHTING
TOURNAMENT TOGETHER...

45
00:03:26,907 --> 00:03:28,327
( crowd cheering )

46
00:03:28,327 --> 00:03:29,957
AND JOINED
THE ZAKKARIA GARRISON.

47
00:03:31,787 --> 00:03:34,417
IT SEEMS LIKE YESTERDAY
WE CAME TO THE CAPITAL

48
00:03:34,417 --> 00:03:36,587
AND MADE IT
INTO THE SWORDCRAFT ACADEMY.

49
00:03:36,587 --> 00:03:40,217
I CAN’T GET OVER HOW AMAZING
IT IS THAT WE’RE EVEN HERE.

50
00:03:40,217 --> 00:03:42,177
Kirito: OH, COME ON.

51
00:03:42,177 --> 00:03:45,467
IT’S BEEN, LIKE, A WHOLE YEAR
SINCE WE MOVED TO THE DORMS.

52
00:03:45,467 --> 00:03:47,307
YOU SHOULD BE BORED
OUT OF YOUR SKULL BY NOW.

53
00:03:47,307 --> 00:03:50,137
( Eugeo chuckles ) I GUESS SO.

54
00:03:50,137 --> 00:03:50,937
Woman: KIRITO!

55
00:03:52,017 --> 00:03:54,227
♪

56
00:03:54,227 --> 00:03:56,317
Kirito: L-LIENA!

57
00:03:56,317 --> 00:03:57,227
Liena: WHAT A COINCIDENCE.

58
00:03:58,777 --> 00:04:00,357
Kirito:
HEY, GOOD MORNING, MA’AM.

59
00:04:00,357 --> 00:04:01,777
- Eugeo: GOOD MORNING, MA’AM!
- Liena: GOOD MORNING.

60
00:04:01,777 --> 00:04:03,157
WE HAVEN’T MET YET.

61
00:04:03,157 --> 00:04:05,697
YOU ARE EUGEO. IS THAT CORRECT?

62
00:04:05,697 --> 00:04:06,697
Eugeo: UM, YES, MA’AM!

63
00:04:06,697 --> 00:04:08,037
( Liena chuckles )

64
00:04:08,037 --> 00:04:09,617
THERE’S NO NEED TO BE NERVOUS.

65
00:04:09,617 --> 00:04:12,117
Kirito: I THOUGHT YOU WERE
GOING HOME FOR THE DAY.

66
00:04:12,117 --> 00:04:14,207
Liena: YES, I WAS
JUST THERE, ACTUALLY.

67
00:04:14,207 --> 00:04:16,127
THEY SENT ME BACK
TO GET SOME THINGS.

68
00:04:16,127 --> 00:04:18,007
Eugeo: UM, MAY I
CARRY THAT FOR YOU?

69
00:04:18,007 --> 00:04:19,127
Liena: THAT’S VERY KIND.

70
00:04:19,127 --> 00:04:20,797
HOWEVER

71
00:04:20,797 --> 00:04:22,217
GOLGOROSSO BALTO’S PAGE.

72
00:04:22,217 --> 00:04:23,717
Eugeo: YOU’RE RIGHT! I’M SORRY!

73
00:04:23,717 --> 00:04:25,177
I WAS OUT OF LINE!

74
00:04:25,177 --> 00:04:26,427
- Liena: AS FOR YOU...
- Kirito: EH?

75
00:04:26,427 --> 00:04:28,467
Liena: YOU ARE MY PAGE, YES?

76
00:04:28,467 --> 00:04:31,307
SO TELL ME, WHY IS IT
YOU DIDN’T OFFER TO HELP FIRST?

77
00:04:31,307 --> 00:04:33,897
Kirito: BUSTED. ( laughs )

78
00:04:33,897 --> 00:04:36,107
Liena: OH, HONESTLY.

79
00:04:36,107 --> 00:04:39,277
I APPRECIATE YOUR OFFER
TO ASSIST ME, REALLY.

80
00:04:39,277 --> 00:04:41,987
HOWEVER, I’M ALMOST FINISHED
WITH MY SHOPPING.

81
00:04:41,987 --> 00:04:44,157
BESIDES, THIS IS
YOUR DAY OF REST.

82
00:04:44,157 --> 00:04:45,987
YOU SHOULDN’T
HAVE TO THINK ABOUT WORK.

83
00:04:45,987 --> 00:04:49,997
YOUR DUTY AS PAGES
WILL BE OVER SOON, ANYWAY.

84
00:04:49,997 --> 00:04:52,997
ONCE WE GRADUATE

85
00:04:52,997 --> 00:04:55,377
Kirito: IF ANYTHING, I WISH I
COULD’VE LEARNED MORE FROM YOU.

86
00:04:55,377 --> 00:04:57,627
Liena: YOUR WORDS ARE TOO KIND.

87
00:04:57,627 --> 00:04:59,047
I AM BLESSED TO BE YOUR MENTOR.

88
00:05:03,127 --> 00:05:04,337
Kirito: THANK YOU
FOR EVERYTHING!

89
00:05:04,337 --> 00:05:06,347
IT WAS AN HONOR KNOWING YOU!

90
00:05:06,347 --> 00:05:08,097
Eugeo: AND AN HONOR FOR ME, TOO!

91
00:05:08,097 --> 00:05:10,177
( Liena sighs ) SAME.

92
00:05:14,477 --> 00:05:16,307
( Eugeo sighs )

93
00:05:16,307 --> 00:05:19,017
Kirito: WHAT THE HECK ARE YOU
GETTING ALL FLUSTERED FOR?

94
00:05:19,017 --> 00:05:22,027
Eugeo: I GUESS IT’S BECAUSE
SORTILIENA’S SO BEAUTIFUL

95
00:05:22,027 --> 00:05:24,197
AND SHE’S KIND OF
INTIMIDATING, TOO.

96
00:05:24,197 --> 00:05:25,447
Kirito: YEAH, YOU GOT A POINT.

97
00:05:25,447 --> 00:05:28,027
I’M A NERVOUS WRECK
WHEN WE SPAR

98
00:05:28,027 --> 00:05:29,407
’CAUSE SHE’S SO INTENSE.

99
00:05:29,407 --> 00:05:32,617
Eugeo: GOLGOROSSO CAN BE
PRETTY INTENSE, TOO.

100
00:05:32,617 --> 00:05:36,037
IN FACT, EVEN AFTER ALL
THE TRAINING I’VE HAD WITH HIM

101
00:05:36,037 --> 00:05:38,037
I STILL CAN’T SCORE
A SINGLE POINT.

102
00:05:38,037 --> 00:05:39,297
Kirito: SAME HERE.

103
00:05:39,297 --> 00:05:41,167
LIENA’S ALWAYS
TWO STEPS AHEAD OF ME

104
00:05:41,167 --> 00:05:43,337
AND SHE’S SECOND SEAT
IN HER CLASS.

105
00:05:43,337 --> 00:05:45,427
Eugeo: I WONDER
HOW STRONG VOLO IS.

106
00:05:45,427 --> 00:05:46,927
HE’S IN THE FIRST SEAT.

107
00:05:46,927 --> 00:05:48,467
Kirito: PRETTY STRONG.

108
00:05:48,467 --> 00:05:51,217
Eugeo: CAN YOU EVEN IMAGINE
BEATING AN UPPERCLASSMAN?

109
00:05:51,217 --> 00:05:52,637
I CERTAINLY CAN’T.

110
00:05:52,637 --> 00:05:55,807
Kirito: AND THAT THERE’S
THE PROBLEM, HUH?

111
00:05:57,977 --> 00:05:59,647
Eugeo: WELL, GOOD NIGHT, KIRITO.

112
00:05:59,647 --> 00:06:01,727
Kirito: HUH? OH. NIGHT.

113
00:06:08,317 --> 00:06:11,117
AFTER BEING STUCK HERE
FOR THE PAST TWO YEARS

114
00:06:11,117 --> 00:06:12,787
I LEARNED THAT, IN THIS WORLD

115
00:06:12,787 --> 00:06:15,997
YOUR TRUE POWER WASN’T
JUST EXPRESSED IN NUMBERS.

116
00:06:17,617 --> 00:06:20,417
ONLY THREE STATS
SHOW UP IN YOUR WINDOW

117
00:06:20,417 --> 00:06:23,337
YOUR LIFE

118
00:06:23,337 --> 00:06:25,467
AND YOUR
SYSTEM CONTROL AUTHORITY.

119
00:06:25,467 --> 00:06:29,507
IF YOUR OBJECT CONTROL
AUTHORITY’S A LOW NUMBER

120
00:06:29,507 --> 00:06:33,217
YOU CAN BARELY EVEN HOLD
A HIGHER-CLASS WEAPON.

121
00:06:33,217 --> 00:06:35,427
BUT IF YOUR STAT’S WAY BIGGER
THAN THE WEAPON’S

122
00:06:35,427 --> 00:06:36,887
IT FEELS CRAZY LIGHT.

123
00:06:38,767 --> 00:06:40,807
YOUR SYSTEM CONTROL
AUTHORITY STAT

124
00:06:40,807 --> 00:06:44,187
TELLS YOU WHAT KIND
OF SACRED ARTS YOU CAN USE.

125
00:06:44,187 --> 00:06:46,987
IF YOU’RE LOW-LEVEL

126
00:06:46,987 --> 00:06:48,817
BUT IF YOU LEVEL UP

127
00:06:48,817 --> 00:06:51,827
YOU GET ACCESS
TO MORE SOPHISTICATED ONES.

128
00:06:54,287 --> 00:06:56,657
THAT’S HOW IT WORKS
IN GAMES, TOO

129
00:06:56,657 --> 00:07:00,247
BUT THERE’S AN EXTRA FEATURE
HERE THAT AFFECTS YOUR STATS.

130
00:07:00,247 --> 00:07:03,127
IT’S SOMETHING "S.A.O."
AND "A.L.O." DIDN’T HAVE.

131
00:07:03,127 --> 00:07:06,377
SOMETIMES, THE STRENGTH
OF A MENTAL IMAGE YOU CREATE

132
00:07:06,377 --> 00:07:08,127
CAN INFLUENCE YOUR STATS.

133
00:07:08,127 --> 00:07:11,637
IF A PERSON HAS THE CONFIDENCE
OR WILL TO WIN

134
00:07:11,637 --> 00:07:15,307
THEIR POWER CAN BE AMPLIFIED
MANY TIMES OVER.

135
00:07:15,307 --> 00:07:18,477
THAT’S WHAT MAKES LIENA
SO POWERFUL.

136
00:07:18,477 --> 00:07:21,727
SHE’S CONFIDENT

137
00:07:21,727 --> 00:07:24,437
SHE HAD THE BEST TRAINING
IN SWORDSMANSHIP.

138
00:07:24,437 --> 00:07:28,777
SO IF YOU CAN IMAGINE YOURSELF
TO BE MORE POWERFUL THAN ANYONE

139
00:07:28,777 --> 00:07:32,867
YOU’LL HAVE THE POTENTIAL TO
REWRITE THE LAWS OF THIS WORLD.

140
00:07:38,207 --> 00:07:40,787
♪

141
00:07:47,417 --> 00:07:49,087
( both grunting )

142
00:07:51,717 --> 00:07:53,297
- ( Liena yells )
- ( Kirito yelps )

143
00:07:56,267 --> 00:07:57,847
( gasps )

144
00:08:17,367 --> 00:08:19,037
( sighs )

145
00:08:19,037 --> 00:08:21,207
YOU WIN AGAIN, AS ALWAYS.

146
00:08:21,207 --> 00:08:23,537
Liena: BUT YOU CAME CLOSE
A FEW TIMES, DIDN’T YOU?

147
00:08:23,537 --> 00:08:25,587
Kirito: NO. IT WAS ALL YOU.

148
00:08:25,587 --> 00:08:27,087
Liena: DON’T BE SO MODEST.

149
00:08:27,087 --> 00:08:29,377
I KNOW YOU STILL HAVE
SOME LATENT POWER

150
00:08:29,377 --> 00:08:31,337
- YOU’RE HIDING FROM ME.
- ( Kirito gasps )

151
00:08:31,337 --> 00:08:34,717
ONE YEAR AGO

152
00:08:34,717 --> 00:08:38,807
BECAUSE I SENSED A SIMILARITY
IN OUR SWORD STYLES

153
00:08:38,807 --> 00:08:41,727
BUT OVER THE COURSE OF THE YEAR

154
00:08:41,727 --> 00:08:44,437
HOW UNREFINED
MY SKILLS ACTUALLY ARE.

155
00:08:44,437 --> 00:08:46,897
Kirito: NO WAY. YOU’RE AMAZING!

156
00:08:46,897 --> 00:08:50,487
IN THE END, I COULDN’T EVEN BEAT
YOU ONCE DURING OUR TRAINING.

157
00:08:50,487 --> 00:08:53,607
Liena: FOR TWO YEARS

158
00:08:53,607 --> 00:08:56,827
THERE IS SOMEONE I HAVE
NOT MANAGED TO BEAT, EITHER.

159
00:08:56,827 --> 00:09:01,117
Kirito: OH. YOU MEAN
FIRST SEAT VOLO LEAVANTEIN.

160
00:09:01,117 --> 00:09:04,457
Liena: YES. BETWEEN YOU AND I

161
00:09:04,457 --> 00:09:09,337
WHENEVER I FACE HIM, I FALTER

162
00:09:09,337 --> 00:09:12,967
NO MATTER HOW HARD I TRAIN

163
00:09:12,967 --> 00:09:16,507
I HAVE THE SKILL OR THE POWER
TO WITHSTAND HIS SWORD.

164
00:09:16,507 --> 00:09:18,057
Kirito: LIENA.

165
00:09:18,057 --> 00:09:19,467
Liena: HOWEVER...

166
00:09:19,467 --> 00:09:22,767
IT IS NOT THE SAME FOR YOU
WHEN YOU FACE ME.

167
00:09:22,767 --> 00:09:24,847
THERE IS MORE
TO THE AINCRAD STYLE

168
00:09:24,847 --> 00:09:26,607
THAT YOU HAVEN’T SHOWN ME

169
00:09:26,607 --> 00:09:28,357
( Kirito gasps )

170
00:09:28,357 --> 00:09:30,817
Liena: SO BEFORE I GRADUATE
THE DAY AFTER TOMORROW

171
00:09:30,817 --> 00:09:33,397
I WANT TO KNOW
EVERYTHING YOU’RE CAPABLE OF.

172
00:09:38,117 --> 00:09:40,197
Kirito: WITH THIS THING?

173
00:09:40,197 --> 00:09:41,247
( gasps )

174
00:09:41,247 --> 00:09:43,657
I WILL, BUT I CAN’T RIGHT NOW.

175
00:09:43,657 --> 00:09:46,417
I’M SORRY. BUT IF YOU
CAN WAIT ’TIL TOMORROW

176
00:09:46,417 --> 00:09:48,457
I PROMISE I’LL SHOW YOU THEN...

177
00:09:48,457 --> 00:09:50,877
THE GREATEST SWORD SKILL
I CAN USE.

178
00:09:50,877 --> 00:09:53,507
Liena: BUT TOMORROW’S
A DAY OF REST.

179
00:09:53,507 --> 00:09:55,007
YOU KNOW TRAINING
IS FORBIDDEN THEN.

180
00:09:55,007 --> 00:09:57,427
Kirito: YEAH

181
00:09:57,427 --> 00:10:00,507
IT’LL BE YOUR--
YOUR GRADUATION PRESENT!

182
00:10:00,507 --> 00:10:03,597
YEAH, THAT’S IT! YOU CAN
GIVE PRESENTS ON DAYS OF REST!

183
00:10:03,597 --> 00:10:05,347
( Liena laughs )

184
00:10:05,347 --> 00:10:07,437
I’VE NEVER HEARD
OF GIFTING SWORD SKILLS BEFORE

185
00:10:07,437 --> 00:10:09,227
BUT IF YOU INSIST.

186
00:10:09,227 --> 00:10:11,317
ALL RIGHT.
I LOOK FORWARD TO IT.

187
00:10:11,317 --> 00:10:13,647
Kirito: AWESOME!
TOMORROW, THEN.

188
00:10:13,647 --> 00:10:15,567
♪

189
00:10:26,747 --> 00:10:27,917
( sighs )

190
00:10:31,087 --> 00:10:32,747
- ( woman clears throat )
- ( Kirito gasps )

191
00:10:32,747 --> 00:10:34,757
KIRITO HERE, MA’AM!

192
00:10:34,757 --> 00:10:36,467
I’M SORRY I’M LATE, MA’AM!

193
00:10:36,467 --> 00:10:38,387
Woman: WHY ARE YOU
38 MINUTES LATE

194
00:10:38,387 --> 00:10:39,757
PRIMARY TRAINEE KIRITO?

195
00:10:39,757 --> 00:10:41,097
Kirito: PRACTICING, MA’AM

196
00:10:41,097 --> 00:10:43,677
WITH ELITE DISCIPLE
SORTILIENA SERLUT.

197
00:10:43,677 --> 00:10:45,927
OUR SESSION WENT LONGER
THAN USUAL TODAY.

198
00:10:45,927 --> 00:10:48,437
Woman: I APPLAUD YOUR COMMITMENT
TO YOUR EDUCATION.

199
00:10:48,437 --> 00:10:51,857
IT IS YOUR DUTY AS A PAGE
TO LEARN FROM YOUR MENTOR.

200
00:10:51,857 --> 00:10:54,897
HOWEVER, IT SEEMS TO ME
THAT YOU THINK YOUR TRAINING

201
00:10:54,897 --> 00:10:56,817
GIVES YOU PERMISSION
TO BREAK YOUR CURFEW.

202
00:10:56,817 --> 00:10:59,777
Kirito: OH, OF COURSE NOT

203
00:10:59,777 --> 00:11:03,697
UH, ALL I WANT IS TO GET BETTER
AS A SWORDSMAN. THAT’S ALL!

204
00:11:03,697 --> 00:11:06,827
ME COMIN’ IN AFTER CURFEW’S
JUST AN ACCIDENT. I SWEAR.

205
00:11:06,827 --> 00:11:10,577
( Azurica sighs ) MEALTIME IS
STARTING IN 17 MINUTES.

206
00:11:10,577 --> 00:11:12,537
MAKE SURE YOU’RE
NOT LATE FOR THAT.

207
00:11:12,537 --> 00:11:14,167
( overlapping chatter )

208
00:11:14,167 --> 00:11:16,547
- Eugeo: WHERE HAVE YOU BEEN?
- Kirito: SORRY!

209
00:11:16,547 --> 00:11:18,377
MY SPARRING SESSION
WITH LIENA WENT LONG.

210
00:11:19,507 --> 00:11:21,217
YUM!

211
00:11:23,847 --> 00:11:25,347
- MMM!
- ( Eugeo chuckles )

212
00:11:27,597 --> 00:11:30,977
Student: I CANNOT TELL YOU
HOW JEALOUS I AM, LORD RAIOS.

213
00:11:30,977 --> 00:11:34,857
AFTER WE TOILED SO HARD
CLEANING THIS CAFETERIA

214
00:11:34,857 --> 00:11:38,397
THEY GET TO JUST WALTZ IN AND
EAT AS IF THEY OWN THE PLACE.

215
00:11:38,397 --> 00:11:40,817
I SO ENVY THEIR GOOD FORTUNE.

216
00:11:40,817 --> 00:11:43,237
Raios: NOW, NOW, HUMBERT.
DON’T SLANDER.

217
00:11:43,237 --> 00:11:45,537
PAGES HAVE THEIR STRUGGLES, TOO.

218
00:11:45,537 --> 00:11:48,577
I’M SURE THEIR DUTIES ARE
BEYOND WHAT EVEN WE CAN IMAGINE.

219
00:11:48,577 --> 00:11:49,747
( Humbert chuckles )

220
00:11:49,747 --> 00:11:51,667
I SUPPOSE YOU’RE RIGHT.

221
00:11:51,667 --> 00:11:54,587
THESE PAGES HAVE TO BE
AT THEIR MENTORS’ BECK AND CALL.

222
00:11:54,587 --> 00:11:57,547
WHY, I HEARD THEY HAVE
TO INDULGE THEIR EVERY WHIM.

223
00:11:57,547 --> 00:12:00,297
Raios: COULD YOU IMAGINE
WHAT IT MUST BE LIKE FOR THEM

224
00:12:00,297 --> 00:12:03,047
HAVING A MENTOR
FROM A LOWER-CLASS HOUSE?

225
00:12:03,047 --> 00:12:05,757
THEY MUST ISSUE
THE MOST OUTLANDISH ORDERS.

226
00:12:05,757 --> 00:12:08,227
Eugeo: IGNORE THOSE TWO JERKS.
JUST EAT.

227
00:12:09,637 --> 00:12:11,347
OH, I’VE BEEN MEANING TO ASK

228
00:12:11,347 --> 00:12:12,727
HOW’S YOUR GARDEN COMING ALONG?

229
00:12:12,727 --> 00:12:15,397
Kirito: MM. ( laughs )

230
00:12:15,397 --> 00:12:17,437
DOING PRETTY GOOD SO FAR

231
00:12:17,437 --> 00:12:19,987
IT SHOULD BE IN FULL BLOOM
IN TIME FOR GRADUATION.

232
00:12:19,987 --> 00:12:21,817
Eugeo: NICE.
CAN’T WAIT TO SEE IT.

233
00:12:21,817 --> 00:12:22,817
( Raios scoffs )

234
00:12:22,817 --> 00:12:24,737
♪

235
00:12:29,447 --> 00:12:31,537
Eugeo: THEY LOOK LIKE
THEY’RE DOING GREAT.

236
00:12:31,537 --> 00:12:33,247
THEY’RE EVEN STARTING TO BUD.

237
00:12:33,247 --> 00:12:34,787
Kirito: IT TOOK THREE TRIES

238
00:12:34,787 --> 00:12:36,747
BUT I FINALLY
GOT THE HANG OF IT.

239
00:12:36,747 --> 00:12:38,837
MAN, I REALLY HOPE
THIS BATCH BLOOMS.

240
00:12:38,837 --> 00:12:40,917
Eugeo: IT’S ON COURSE TO

241
00:12:40,917 --> 00:12:42,377
THEY’RE GOING TO MAKE

242
00:12:42,377 --> 00:12:44,297
A WONDERFUL GRADUATION GIFT
FOR LIENA.

243
00:12:44,297 --> 00:12:45,297
YOU’RE SO THOUGHTFUL.

244
00:12:45,297 --> 00:12:46,717
( Kirito chuckles )

245
00:12:46,717 --> 00:12:48,137
GIVE ME A BREAK.

246
00:12:48,137 --> 00:12:51,387
Eugeo: AFTER KNOWING YOU
FOR THE PAST TWO YEARS

247
00:12:51,387 --> 00:12:54,397
I HAD NO IDEA YOU LIKED
PUTTERING AROUND A GARDEN.

248
00:12:54,397 --> 00:12:56,397
Kirito: YEAH.
I’M AS SURPRISED AS YOU.

249
00:12:56,397 --> 00:12:58,897
Eugeo: YOU KNOW WHAT?
THIS MIGHT BE A SIGN

250
00:12:58,897 --> 00:13:00,687
THAT YOUR MEMORIES
ARE COMING BACK.

251
00:13:00,687 --> 00:13:04,197
MAYBE BEFORE YOU CAME TO RULID

252
00:13:04,197 --> 00:13:07,657
YEAH, MAYBE THAT
WAS YOUR CALLING.

253
00:13:07,657 --> 00:13:09,657
Kirito: UH, YEAH, MAYBE.

254
00:13:09,657 --> 00:13:12,117
I’M, UH, GONNA GET SOME WATER.

255
00:13:12,117 --> 00:13:14,117
- Eugeo: WAIT.
- Kirito: WHAT?

256
00:13:14,117 --> 00:13:17,917
Eugeo: AT SOME POINT, YOU MAY
END UP GETTING YOUR MEMORY BACK.

257
00:13:17,917 --> 00:13:19,877
- WHAT THEN?
- Kirito: HUH?

258
00:13:19,877 --> 00:13:21,717
WH-WHAT DO YOU MEAN?

259
00:13:21,717 --> 00:13:23,717
Eugeo: YOU’RE TRAINING
TO BE AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT

260
00:13:23,717 --> 00:13:27,677
BUT YOU’RE ONLY HERE
BECAUSE YOU’RE HELPING ME.

261
00:13:27,677 --> 00:13:29,717
I’M HERE
BECAUSE I WANT TO FIND ALICE

262
00:13:29,717 --> 00:13:31,427
AND BRING HER BACK HOME.

263
00:13:31,427 --> 00:13:35,517
WHAT IF YOU REMEMBER YOUR HOME?

264
00:13:37,807 --> 00:13:38,567
( Kirito sighs )

265
00:13:38,567 --> 00:13:40,817
♪

266
00:13:40,817 --> 00:13:42,897
( Eugeo gasps )

267
00:13:42,897 --> 00:13:46,027
Kirito: IF I DO GET MY MEMORY
BACK, I AIN’T GOIN’ HOME.

268
00:13:46,027 --> 00:13:48,487
THERE’S ONE THING I KNOW.

269
00:13:48,487 --> 00:13:50,827
I’M A SWORDSMAN ALL THE WAY.

270
00:13:50,827 --> 00:13:52,407
FOR A SWORDSMAN

271
00:13:52,407 --> 00:13:55,497
BEING AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT’S
A DREAM JOB.

272
00:13:55,497 --> 00:13:58,127
Eugeo: I’M WEAK.
I ALWAYS HAVE BEEN.

273
00:13:58,127 --> 00:14:02,627
IF I HADN’T MET YOU

274
00:14:02,627 --> 00:14:06,047
I GUESS I’D STILL BE
SWINGING THAT AX RIGHT NOW

275
00:14:06,047 --> 00:14:09,847
STILL STUCK IN MY VILLAGE

276
00:14:09,847 --> 00:14:12,517
THE ONLY REASON I’M EVEN HERE

277
00:14:12,517 --> 00:14:15,977
IS BECAUSE I HAD YOU WITH ME
TO LEAD THE WAY.

278
00:14:15,977 --> 00:14:17,807
IT’S ALL BECAUSE OF YOU.

279
00:14:17,807 --> 00:14:22,437
AND JUST NOW, WHEN YOU SAID YOU
WOULDN’T RETURN TO YOUR HOME

280
00:14:22,437 --> 00:14:25,027
EVEN IF YOU GOT
YOUR MEMORY BACK

281
00:14:25,027 --> 00:14:26,907
IT FILLED ME WITH SUCH RELIEF.

282
00:14:26,907 --> 00:14:29,867
Kirito: AW, COME ON.
QUIT YOUR MOPIN’.

283
00:14:29,867 --> 00:14:31,277
YOU THINK I COULD’VE MADE IT

284
00:14:31,277 --> 00:14:32,987
ALL THE WAY
TO THE CAPITAL BY MYSELF?

285
00:14:32,987 --> 00:14:35,157
I DIDN’T KNOW WHERE IT WAS.

286
00:14:35,157 --> 00:14:36,997
PLUS, MY MEMORY’S A BLANK

287
00:14:36,997 --> 00:14:41,207
AND, WORSE, I DIDN’T HAVE
TWO COINS TO RUB TOGETHER.

288
00:14:41,207 --> 00:14:44,047
THE ONLY REASON I’M HERE NOW
IS ’CAUSE OF YOU.

289
00:14:44,047 --> 00:14:45,917
WE MAKE A GREAT TEAM

290
00:14:45,917 --> 00:14:47,627
SO WHY MESS THAT UP?

291
00:14:47,627 --> 00:14:50,547
WE’RE BETTER
IF WE STICK TOGETHER.

292
00:14:50,547 --> 00:14:53,057
WE CAN WORRY
ABOUT GOING OUR OWN WAYS

293
00:14:53,057 --> 00:14:54,767
AFTER WE BECOME
INTEGRITY KNIGHTS. DEAL?

294
00:14:58,137 --> 00:14:59,727
( Eugeo chuckles ) OKAY, DEAL.

295
00:15:01,817 --> 00:15:03,567
FIRST THINGS FIRST, THOUGH.

296
00:15:03,567 --> 00:15:05,357
WE HAVE TO ACE THIS EXAM.

297
00:15:05,357 --> 00:15:07,697
ONLY THE TOP 12
WILL GET TO ADVANCE.

298
00:15:07,697 --> 00:15:09,737
Kirito: YEAH, WELL

299
00:15:09,737 --> 00:15:11,527
WITH MY SACRED ARTS SKILLS.

300
00:15:11,527 --> 00:15:14,037
SO, WHAT DO YOU SAY?
WANNA HELP YOUR PARTNER OUT?

301
00:15:14,037 --> 00:15:16,617
( Eugeo laughs ) OF COURSE.

302
00:15:16,617 --> 00:15:18,667
IN FACT

303
00:15:18,667 --> 00:15:19,827
SO WE CAN STUDY.

304
00:15:19,827 --> 00:15:21,787
Kirito: I CAN’T.

305
00:15:21,787 --> 00:15:23,247
Eugeo: OH. RIGHT, I FORGOT.

306
00:15:23,247 --> 00:15:25,707
Kirito: YUP. TOMORROW’S
THE DAY I PICK IT UP.

307
00:15:25,707 --> 00:15:27,257
Eugeo: I BET YOU’RE EXCITED.

308
00:15:27,257 --> 00:15:29,467
Kirito: HELL, YEAH!
I’VE BEEN WAITING ALL YEAR.

309
00:15:29,467 --> 00:15:32,427
CAN’T WAIT TO TRY IT OUT.

310
00:15:32,427 --> 00:15:34,427
( horse neighs )

311
00:15:34,427 --> 00:15:35,927
- ( overlapping chatter )

312
00:15:35,927 --> 00:15:37,427
- ( thump )
- ( both gasp )

313
00:15:37,427 --> 00:15:39,637
Sadore: THESE THINGS
DON’T GROW ON TREES!

314
00:15:39,637 --> 00:15:43,227
A BLACK-BRICK GRINDSTONE’S
SUPPOSED TO LAST ME THREE YEARS!

315
00:15:43,227 --> 00:15:44,937
I WENT THROUGH
SIX OF ’EM THIS YEAR

316
00:15:44,937 --> 00:15:46,107
WORKIN’ ON THAT THING!

317
00:15:46,107 --> 00:15:49,317
Kirito: UH, YEAH

318
00:15:49,317 --> 00:15:51,157
Sadore: THAT BRANCH
WAS SO TOUGH

319
00:15:51,157 --> 00:15:54,277
IT TOOK ME A WHOLE DAMN DAY
JUST TO SCRAPE A SLIVER OFF IT.

320
00:15:54,277 --> 00:15:57,077
YOU HAVE ANY IDEA
HOW MANY HOURS I SPENT

321
00:15:57,077 --> 00:15:58,287
SHAVIN’ AWAY AT THIS THING?!

322
00:16:00,167 --> 00:16:01,957
Garitta: THE TIP
OF THE GIGAS CEDAR

323
00:16:01,957 --> 00:16:05,417
IS THE PART THAT ABSORBED
ALL THE BLESSINGS OF SOLUS.

324
00:16:11,127 --> 00:16:13,297
TAKE IT ON YOUR JOURNEY

325
00:16:13,297 --> 00:16:15,887
AND WHEN YOU REACH THE CAPITAL

326
00:16:15,887 --> 00:16:19,267
GO AND SEE SADORE THE CRAFTSMAN

327
00:16:19,267 --> 00:16:22,477
HE’LL MAKE
A WONDERFUL SWORD FROM IT.

328
00:16:23,977 --> 00:16:24,977
Sadore: SEE THAT?

329
00:16:24,977 --> 00:16:27,107
I’M A CRAFTSMAN BY CALLING

330
00:16:27,107 --> 00:16:28,567
BUT METALSMITHING’S WHERE MY--

331
00:16:28,567 --> 00:16:31,527
Kirito: I’M SORRY.
DID YOU FINISH THE SWORD?

332
00:16:31,527 --> 00:16:33,197
( Sadore grumbling )

333
00:16:38,077 --> 00:16:39,947
YOUNG MAN...

334
00:16:39,947 --> 00:16:43,497
I DON’T REMEMBER US
TALKING ABOUT MONEY YET.

335
00:16:43,497 --> 00:16:44,997
( Kirito gasps )

336
00:16:44,997 --> 00:16:47,837
Eugeo: DON’T WORRY. IT’S OKAY.
PAY THE MAN.

337
00:16:47,837 --> 00:16:50,087
IF YOU DON’T HAVE ENOUGH

338
00:16:50,087 --> 00:16:52,507
Sadore: OF COURSE

339
00:16:52,507 --> 00:16:53,927
- Kirito: HUH? REALLY?!
- Eugeo: HUH? REALLY?!

340
00:16:53,927 --> 00:16:56,257
Sadore: REALLY

341
00:16:56,257 --> 00:16:59,097
YOU GOTTA BE ABLE
TO SWING THIS MONSTER. HEH.

342
00:16:59,097 --> 00:17:01,227
GOOD LUCK. WHEN I FINISHED

343
00:17:01,227 --> 00:17:04,147
I TRIED PICKING IT UP

344
00:17:04,147 --> 00:17:06,477
Kirito: NO WAY. IT DID?

345
00:17:11,777 --> 00:17:12,857
( gasps )

346
00:17:12,857 --> 00:17:14,777
♪

347
00:17:19,827 --> 00:17:21,287
Eugeo: WHAT’S WRONG? DRAW IT.

348
00:17:23,077 --> 00:17:25,247
Kirito: OKAY. HERE GOES.

349
00:17:43,727 --> 00:17:44,387
( grunts )

350
00:17:49,147 --> 00:17:51,647
( clapping )

351
00:17:51,647 --> 00:17:53,487
Eugeo: NICE FORM, KIRITO.

352
00:17:53,487 --> 00:17:56,157
Sadore: HUH!
SO A TRAINEE CAN HANDLE IT.

353
00:17:56,157 --> 00:17:57,777
WELL, NOW I’VE SEEN EVERYTHING.

354
00:17:57,777 --> 00:17:59,077
Kirito: IT’S A GOOD SWORD.

355
00:17:59,077 --> 00:18:00,907
Sadore: DAMN RIGHT, IT IS!

356
00:18:00,907 --> 00:18:02,997
ANYWAY, THE SWORD’S ALL YOURS.

357
00:18:02,997 --> 00:18:04,577
I’M A MAN OF MY WORD

358
00:18:06,117 --> 00:18:07,167
( Kirito gasps )

359
00:18:07,167 --> 00:18:08,747
THANKS A LOT!

360
00:18:10,917 --> 00:18:13,797
HEY, I’M GONNA GO
TRY THIS OUT FOR A BIT.

361
00:18:13,797 --> 00:18:15,717
Eugeo: OKAY.
JUST DON’T BE LATE FOR DINNER!

362
00:18:15,717 --> 00:18:16,837
Kirito: I WON’T!

363
00:18:16,837 --> 00:18:19,177
- ( grunts )
- ( sword swings )

364
00:18:21,177 --> 00:18:23,097
( grunting )

365
00:18:27,187 --> 00:18:30,767
THIS WORLD’S NO GAME

366
00:18:30,767 --> 00:18:35,317
I CAN ONLY DO TWO-HIT COMBOS
WITH MY PRACTICE SWORD.

367
00:18:35,317 --> 00:18:37,567
LET’S SEE WHAT THIS CAN DO.

368
00:18:37,567 --> 00:18:38,987
( yells )

369
00:18:44,947 --> 00:18:46,117
Volo: HUH.

370
00:18:48,167 --> 00:18:49,377
Kirito: THIS IS GREAT!

371
00:18:49,377 --> 00:18:51,747
I CAN KEEP MY PROMISE
TO LIENA NOW!

372
00:18:51,747 --> 00:18:54,257
NO, WAIT.
HOW ’BOUT A FIVE-PARTER?

373
00:18:54,257 --> 00:18:56,297
THE BLUE ROSE SWORD
COULDN’T DO ONE

374
00:18:56,297 --> 00:18:57,507
BUT MAYBE THIS CAN.

375
00:19:02,717 --> 00:19:03,887
( yells )

376
00:19:03,887 --> 00:19:06,637
( groans )

377
00:19:09,937 --> 00:19:11,057
Volo: HMPH.

378
00:19:11,057 --> 00:19:13,227
( Kirito groans )

379
00:19:13,227 --> 00:19:14,277
GUESS IT CAN’T.

380
00:19:14,277 --> 00:19:15,897
- ( footsteps )
- OH?

381
00:19:21,277 --> 00:19:23,077
FIRST SEAT LEVANTEIN!

382
00:19:24,157 --> 00:19:25,867
( gasps )

383
00:19:25,867 --> 00:19:29,167
I-I’M SORRY

384
00:19:29,167 --> 00:19:32,127
I DIDN’T MEAN TO GET DIRT
ON YOUR UNIFORM!

385
00:19:32,127 --> 00:19:33,877
Volo: I’VE SEEN YOU BEFORE.

386
00:19:33,877 --> 00:19:36,127
YOU’RE ELITE DISCIPLE
SERLUT’S PAGE.

387
00:19:36,127 --> 00:19:37,377
Kirito: YES, SIR

388
00:19:37,377 --> 00:19:39,337
- PRIMARY TRAINEE KIRITO.
- Volo: RIGHT.

389
00:19:39,337 --> 00:19:42,797
PRACTICING THE SWORD
IS FORBIDDEN ON A DAY OF REST.

390
00:19:42,797 --> 00:19:45,137
Kirito: I, UM--I WASN’T.

391
00:19:45,137 --> 00:19:46,977
THIS ISN’T PRACTICE, SIR.

392
00:19:46,977 --> 00:19:50,307
UM, I WAS JUST TRYING OUT
MY NEW SWORD.

393
00:19:50,307 --> 00:19:52,017
I COULDN’T WAIT ’TIL TOMORROW.

394
00:19:52,017 --> 00:19:55,567
Volo: YOUR TEST SWINGS WERE--
HOW SHALL I SAY?

395
00:19:55,567 --> 00:19:58,187
- ENTHUSIASTIC.
- ( Kirito stammers )

396
00:19:58,187 --> 00:20:01,447
Volo: YOU AND I
ARE SIMILAR THAT WAY.

397
00:20:01,447 --> 00:20:05,117
WE BOTH SEARCH FOR A REASON
TO WIELD A SWORD

398
00:20:05,117 --> 00:20:07,447
EVEN ON A DAY OF REST

399
00:20:07,447 --> 00:20:09,537
YEARNING TO SCRATCH THAT ITCH.

400
00:20:09,537 --> 00:20:11,667
- Kirito: YOU, TOO?
- Volo: YES

401
00:20:11,667 --> 00:20:14,537
SO I SHALL OVERLOOK
THAT TRANSGRESSION.

402
00:20:14,537 --> 00:20:15,747
Kirito:
YOU’RE VERY GENEROUS, SIR.

403
00:20:15,747 --> 00:20:17,047
THANK YOU FOR--

404
00:20:17,047 --> 00:20:19,217
Volo: DO NOT THANK ME YET

405
00:20:19,217 --> 00:20:21,507
Kirito: UH, PARDON?

406
00:20:21,507 --> 00:20:24,387
Volo: I DID NOT SAY
I WOULD FORGIVE YOU FOR THIS.

407
00:20:24,387 --> 00:20:26,217
( overlapping chatter )

408
00:20:31,807 --> 00:20:33,227
Kirito: NEWS TRAVELS FAST.

409
00:20:33,227 --> 00:20:34,227
( door closes )

410
00:20:34,227 --> 00:20:36,067
Eugeo: KIRITO!

411
00:20:36,067 --> 00:20:38,437
WHAT’D YOU DO THIS TIME?

412
00:20:38,437 --> 00:20:39,987
Kirito: NOTHIN’. ( chuckles )

413
00:20:39,987 --> 00:20:43,197
Eugeo: OH, WELL.
IT WAS A GOOD RUN.

414
00:20:43,197 --> 00:20:46,077
YOU SURVIVED A WHOLE YEAR HERE
WITHOUT GETTING INTO TROUBLE.

415
00:20:46,077 --> 00:20:48,197
Kirito: NEW RECORD, PARTNER!

416
00:20:48,197 --> 00:20:51,747
Liena: LORD LEVANTEIN

417
00:20:51,747 --> 00:20:53,827
Volo: JUST A MINOR INFRACTION.

418
00:20:53,827 --> 00:20:56,537
YOUR PAGE
WAS DISRESPECTFUL TO ME

419
00:20:56,537 --> 00:20:59,337
NOTHING THAT DEMANDS
SERIOUS PUNISHMENT, MIND YOU

420
00:20:59,337 --> 00:21:02,257
SO WE SHALL SETTLE IT
BY SPARRING WITH REAL SWORDS.

421
00:21:02,257 --> 00:21:04,297
Liena: WHAT DID YOU SAY?

422
00:21:04,297 --> 00:21:07,057
Kirito: YOU DON’T HAVE TO WORRY
ABOUT ME, MA’AM. REALLY.

423
00:21:07,057 --> 00:21:08,767
I CAN HANDLE MYSELF.

424
00:21:08,767 --> 00:21:11,017
IN FACT, I SORTA FEEL HONORED

425
00:21:11,017 --> 00:21:13,097
TO GET THE CHANCE TO SPAR
WITH THE FIRST SEAT HERE.

426
00:21:13,097 --> 00:21:14,647
Liena: KIRITO...

427
00:21:14,647 --> 00:21:16,437
HAVE YOU DISCUSSED
THE RULES WITH HIM YET?

428
00:21:16,437 --> 00:21:19,277
Kirito: NO, BUT SINCE
WE’RE USING REAL SWORDS

429
00:21:19,277 --> 00:21:20,857
ISN’T IT STOP-SHORT?

430
00:21:20,857 --> 00:21:22,897
Volo: I FORGOT
TO MENTION SOMETHING EARLIER.

431
00:21:22,897 --> 00:21:26,487
I DO NOT ENGAGE
IN SHORT-STOP DUELS.

432
00:21:26,487 --> 00:21:30,497
FOR ALL MY PERSONAL MATCHES

433
00:21:30,497 --> 00:21:32,997
Liena: HE’S NEVER FOUGHT
A MATCH WITH REAL SWORDS!

434
00:21:32,997 --> 00:21:34,367
BESIDES, YOU NEED HIS CONSENT!

435
00:21:34,367 --> 00:21:36,707
Volo: OF COURSE. MINE, TOO.

436
00:21:36,707 --> 00:21:39,587
THIS CANNOT PROCEED
UNLESS WE BOTH AGREE.

437
00:21:39,587 --> 00:21:43,627
AND IF HE DOES NOT

438
00:21:43,627 --> 00:21:46,337
WELL, TRAINEE KIRITO

439
00:21:46,337 --> 00:21:48,427
Liena: DON’T DO IT, KIRITO.

440
00:21:48,427 --> 00:21:51,057
VOLO’S STRONG. HE WILL HURT YOU.

441
00:21:51,057 --> 00:21:55,057
Kirito: I THINK I’LL LET YOU
DECIDE IT, LORD LEVANTEIN.

442
00:21:55,057 --> 00:21:57,147
I’M THE ONE
BEING PUNISHED, AFTER ALL.

443
00:21:57,147 --> 00:21:58,397
( Volo sighs )

444
00:21:58,397 --> 00:22:00,397
( Eugeo sighs )

445
00:22:05,737 --> 00:22:06,987
♪

446
00:22:06,987 --> 00:22:08,657
( singing in Japanese )

447
00:22:43,067 --> 00:22:46,897
♪ THE IRIS TO YOU ♪
